  "releaseNotes": "## v3.61.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.60.0:\n\n- Simplify a negated comparison in TransformBoxState ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Add TransformBox, move and scale handles on a rectangle in its own frame [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [patch] Cover the taskbar icon's update-tick hook ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- [patch] Show the window icon on the Windows taskbar ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))",
